WEBVTT

00:31.630 --> 00:35.180
♪ Pink hands so fine ♪

00:35.200 --> 00:38.580
♪ Gold-branded wine ♪

00:38.850 --> 00:44.820
♪ Spring paints willows green;
palace walls can't confine ♪

00:45.980 --> 00:49.610
♪ East wind unfair ♪

00:49.630 --> 00:53.140
♪ Happy times rare ♪

00:53.160 --> 00:56.650
♪ In my heart, sad thoughts throng ♪

00:56.670 --> 01:00.180
♪ We've severed for years long ♪

01:00.200 --> 01:06.260
♪ Wrong, wrong, wrong ♪

01:19.520 --> 01:23.800
Si Jin

01:23.820 --> 01:28.320
Episode 34

01:30.840 --> 01:32.800
(Grand Princess's Mansion)

01:32.820 --> 01:34.000
Your Grace,

01:34.020 --> 01:35.260
hurry and apologize

01:35.260 --> 01:36.860
to your mother.

01:38.180 --> 01:41.420
Mother, I'm sorry.

01:41.970 --> 01:44.240
I should've told you about that letter,

01:44.260 --> 01:45.950
but I did burn it.

01:45.970 --> 01:47.880
What's the point of saying that now?

01:47.900 --> 01:48.770
Someone,

01:48.770 --> 01:50.530
escort her to the villa.

01:50.620 --> 01:52.690
No, Mother, Mother,

01:52.690 --> 01:54.530
I can't marry him!

01:54.850 --> 01:56.630
Why don't you have him killed now?

01:56.650 --> 01:58.210
I'm your only daughter.

01:58.210 --> 02:00.300
You can't force me to marry that scum!

02:00.300 --> 02:02.770
You could've begged my uncle for mercy

02:02.770 --> 02:04.140
and he'd have pardoned everything,

02:04.140 --> 02:05.580
Mother!

02:05.810 --> 02:07.780
Enough of your nonsense!

02:07.860 --> 02:09.700
Didn't you see your uncle's gaze?

02:09.700 --> 02:12.070
Never has he doubted me so!

02:12.090 --> 02:14.230
Years of my meticulous effort

02:14.250 --> 02:16.190
to earn His Majesty's trust

02:16.210 --> 02:17.810
are ruined by your willful

02:17.810 --> 02:19.120
recklessness!

02:19.140 --> 02:21.560
I've coddled you too long.

02:21.580 --> 02:24.370
It's time you learned a proper lesson,

02:24.580 --> 02:26.460
lest both my position

02:26.740 --> 02:28.160
and my very life

02:28.180 --> 02:30.530
fall to ruin by your hand.

02:34.460 --> 02:36.090
I see now!

02:36.250 --> 02:37.490
What you value most

02:37.490 --> 02:38.770
is your brother

02:38.770 --> 02:39.740
and your power,

02:39.740 --> 02:42.250
never me, your own daughter!

02:44.650 --> 02:46.900
If you still want to be a princess,

02:46.930 --> 02:48.790
be Rongyang's daughter,

02:48.810 --> 02:51.580
you must marry Zhu Ziyu!

02:51.620 --> 02:52.960
Close the door!

02:52.980 --> 02:56.030
I refuse, Mother!

02:56.050 --> 02:58.580
I refuse!

03:05.250 --> 03:07.810
Mother, I refuse!

03:10.860 --> 03:14.300
I refuse to marry him, Mother!

03:15.930 --> 03:17.850
Mother!

03:24.140 --> 03:27.410
I refuse to marry him, Mother!

03:27.980 --> 03:30.130
I refuse!

03:36.860 --> 03:40.000
I refuse to marry Zhu Ziyu, Mother!

03:40.020 --> 03:42.580
I refuse to marry him!

03:57.460 --> 03:59.780
Mingyue, Mingyue.

04:01.330 --> 04:02.780
Father,

04:02.810 --> 04:05.160
Mother let me marry Zhu Ziyu,

04:05.180 --> 04:07.080
but I don't want to.

04:07.100 --> 04:09.370
I really don't, Father!

04:09.370 --> 04:11.730
I know. Then don't marry him.

04:11.890 --> 04:12.890
Let me take you back.

04:12.890 --> 04:14.280
Rise.

04:14.300 --> 04:15.740
Be careful.

04:15.810 --> 04:17.650
I'm not going.

04:17.860 --> 04:19.250
General Cui, stop!

04:19.250 --> 04:20.900
Get out of the way.

04:21.570 --> 04:22.640
General Cui!

04:22.660 --> 04:24.100
Come.

04:25.450 --> 04:26.370
What's wrong?

04:26.370 --> 04:28.790
I can't leave in disgrace.

04:28.810 --> 04:31.160
It would only let them have their way!

04:31.180 --> 04:34.290
Jiang Si, Yu Jin,

04:35.570 --> 04:37.900
the humiliation I suffered today,

04:38.660 --> 04:40.570
I will make them repay it tenfold!

04:40.570 --> 04:42.050
Mingyue,

04:42.050 --> 04:43.450
you're just like your mother!

04:43.450 --> 04:45.650
Indeed, I am like her.

04:46.130 --> 04:48.230
I was born from her, raised by her.

04:48.250 --> 04:50.340
You've never cared for me since childhood,

04:50.450 --> 04:52.460
so you don't need to start now.

04:58.540 --> 04:59.960
Here.

04:59.980 --> 05:00.900
Don't let her get wet.

05:00.900 --> 05:05.600
(Grand Princess's Mansion)

05:08.720 --> 05:16.000
(Graceful as Soaring Swan)

05:55.010 --> 05:56.850
It's our wedding night.

05:57.620 --> 05:59.520
Won't you join me for a drink, honey?

05:59.540 --> 06:01.200
I'm not your honey.

06:01.220 --> 06:03.140
We just tied the knot.

06:03.570 --> 06:05.280
His Majesty granted our marriage.

06:05.300 --> 06:06.960
What do you think you are?

06:06.980 --> 06:08.820
How dare you speak so insolently?

06:12.890 --> 06:13.990
Indeed,

06:14.010 --> 06:16.380
if not for His Majesty's decree,

06:17.220 --> 06:19.340
I've killed you long ago.

06:21.570 --> 06:23.110
Rest assured.

06:23.130 --> 06:25.050
I have countless ways to make your life

06:25.540 --> 06:28.530
more miserable than death.

06:29.570 --> 06:31.940
You'll soon realize

06:32.010 --> 06:33.740
you'd have been better off

06:33.740 --> 06:36.490
dying with your family during exile.

06:37.930 --> 06:39.050
I've promised

06:39.050 --> 06:41.020
not to make this public.

06:44.010 --> 06:47.020
Why do you have to exterminate us?

06:50.010 --> 06:52.220
You have only yourself to blame.

06:53.220 --> 06:55.530
They died because of you.

06:59.300 --> 07:00.740
Yes.

07:02.050 --> 07:04.940
It's all my fault, my fault.

07:05.980 --> 07:07.280
If not for me,

07:07.300 --> 07:09.140
they would still be alive.

07:10.780 --> 07:12.970
Yi wouldn't have left me,

07:15.010 --> 07:16.400
and I'd never have to

07:16.420 --> 07:18.610
face a life without Yan.

07:20.980 --> 07:23.340
How pathetic you are.

07:25.570 --> 07:27.010
Rest assured.

07:28.740 --> 07:30.050
Your precious

07:30.050 --> 07:32.850
Jiang Yi and daughter

07:35.220 --> 07:36.250
will suffer

07:36.250 --> 07:38.700
every misery.

07:40.180 --> 07:41.940
You'll learn

07:43.180 --> 07:44.550
what dire consequences

07:44.570 --> 07:47.700
await those who cross me.

08:19.660 --> 08:22.730
Let's drink, darling.

08:24.890 --> 08:26.540
Get lost!

08:26.860 --> 08:29.660
Get out of my sight. You make me sick.

08:30.770 --> 08:32.210
Scram!

08:48.410 --> 08:50.300
The candle went out.

08:51.650 --> 08:53.580
That's a terrible omen.

09:03.200 --> 09:06.110
(Luxurious and Gorgeous)

09:06.130 --> 09:08.080
How is my heart

09:08.100 --> 09:10.010
pounding so fiercely?

09:11.580 --> 09:13.220
Where is Mingyue?

09:14.740 --> 09:16.390
As you ordered,

09:16.410 --> 09:18.490
she went to Zhu Ziyu at the villa.

09:19.700 --> 09:21.420
I owe her much.

09:24.170 --> 09:26.460
I will grant whatever she desires

09:27.700 --> 09:29.970
in the future.

09:30.060 --> 09:32.580
Do you truly believe I wanted to marry you?

09:32.860 --> 09:35.060
Today, I'll take your life

09:35.170 --> 09:37.970
to avenge the 83 souls of my family.

09:40.130 --> 09:42.180
Are you here for vengeance?

09:44.740 --> 09:46.370
Why not?

09:46.940 --> 09:49.890
Should I let you keep hurting my family?

09:51.740 --> 09:53.220
Zhu Ziyu.

10:20.580 --> 10:22.020
Father,

10:22.740 --> 10:24.180
Mother.

10:25.170 --> 10:27.300
Your son has avenged you.

10:34.340 --> 10:39.910
♪ Life is like flowers,
blooming and fading with the seasons ♪

10:40.870 --> 10:46.030
♪ Wind leaves marks, swaying in the breeze ♪

10:46.640 --> 10:49.750
♪ I don't wish for favors from the heavens ♪

10:49.770 --> 10:52.740
♪ To enjoy a blessed life ♪

10:53.020 --> 10:59.820
♪ I only wish to be unburdened ♪

11:01.860 --> 11:03.300
Jiang Yi,

11:05.770 --> 11:07.210
this is

11:08.580 --> 11:09.460
the last thing

11:09.460 --> 11:11.370
I can do for you.

11:11.860 --> 11:14.680
♪ As the sun sets, the wise seek redemption ♪

11:14.700 --> 11:15.620
No!

11:15.620 --> 11:18.960
♪ I only wish to wake up one day ♪

11:18.960 --> 11:22.960
♪ I won't lose with myself in the game ♪

11:22.980 --> 11:24.600
I'm not a good father.

11:24.600 --> 11:27.010
♪ Alas, is it too late ♪

11:27.010 --> 11:29.090
Tell Yan to forget me.

11:31.220 --> 11:33.550
Mother, help me!

11:33.550 --> 11:37.350
♪ To stop indulging myself ♪

11:37.350 --> 11:40.940
(Graceful as Soaring Swan)

11:40.940 --> 11:44.700
♪ To be remedied ♪

11:44.720 --> 11:50.490
♪ A small greed forms
an unbreakable tie ♪

11:50.510 --> 11:56.660
♪ Is the resting shore too shallow ♪

11:56.680 --> 11:59.230
♪ Is the yearning in my heart ♪

11:59.250 --> 12:00.730
Yet why do I

12:03.290 --> 12:06.130
feel more and more uneasy,

12:08.650 --> 12:10.380
like something terrible is about to happen.

12:10.380 --> 12:17.330
♪ A shared bond, a tragic ending ♪

12:18.010 --> 12:19.450
Shijiu,

12:19.980 --> 12:22.060
go check on Mingyue at the villa.

12:23.220 --> 12:26.130
Tell her not to lose her temper.

12:26.370 --> 12:28.130
The most important thing now

12:28.740 --> 12:31.060
is to keep Zhu Ziyu alive.

12:31.580 --> 12:33.020
Yes.

12:50.840 --> 12:54.720
(Luxurious and Gorgeous)

12:54.740 --> 12:56.460
It's almost dawn,

12:57.940 --> 12:59.660
and the rain has stopped.

13:03.820 --> 13:06.580
There shouldn't be any trouble now.

13:18.250 --> 13:20.890
But why is my eyelid

13:21.410 --> 13:23.130
twitching nonstop?

13:35.960 --> 13:39.480
(Prince Yan's Mansion)

13:41.440 --> 13:44.440
(Jade Bloom Aroma)

13:45.650 --> 13:47.540
May you be blessed

13:48.890 --> 13:51.130
with many children

13:52.100 --> 13:54.250
to continue the family line

13:54.980 --> 13:57.180
and make your clan thrive.

13:58.220 --> 14:00.180
Drink together!

14:02.650 --> 14:03.800
You never drink.

14:03.820 --> 14:05.920
Let's skip this step.

14:05.940 --> 14:07.720
We have to drink up

14:07.740 --> 14:10.060
to finally become a married couple.

14:10.250 --> 14:11.690
I'll make an exception.

14:13.860 --> 14:14.960
Okay.

14:14.980 --> 14:16.940
Drink together,

14:19.410 --> 14:21.540
solemn and auspicious.

14:28.620 --> 14:30.060
Braid your hair!

14:39.940 --> 14:41.470
Bound by hair as man and wife.

14:41.490 --> 14:43.340
In love and trust we share our life.

14:49.100 --> 14:50.560
Ceremony complete!

14:50.580 --> 14:52.020
Bring the feast!

14:53.860 --> 14:55.510
This is lily lotus soup.

14:55.530 --> 14:56.650
May Your Highnesses enjoy

14:56.650 --> 14:59.420
harmonious union with plentiful descendants.

15:00.300 --> 15:01.170
Ms. Hua,

15:01.170 --> 15:04.350
does this food box have ten tiers?

15:04.370 --> 15:05.100
Indeed, Your Highness.

15:05.100 --> 15:06.270
Ten tiers for auspicious blessings,

15:06.270 --> 15:07.470
perfection in all ten aspects.

15:07.490 --> 15:09.680
Inside are sesame glutinous rice balls

15:09.700 --> 15:11.800
for harmony and togetherness,

15:11.820 --> 15:13.870
sweet glutinous rice balls,

15:13.890 --> 15:15.510
red date and longan soup,

15:15.530 --> 15:17.870
sweet osmanthus lotus root, and red beans...

15:17.890 --> 15:19.010
Ms. Hua, don't worry.

15:19.010 --> 15:20.170
They'll definitely eat it.

15:20.170 --> 15:21.180
Why don't we

15:21.190 --> 15:22.100
take a rest first?

15:22.100 --> 15:23.390
Right, we'll head out first.

15:23.410 --> 15:25.720
The rituals aren't finished yet.

15:25.740 --> 15:27.960
Your Highness, make sure to eat it!

15:27.980 --> 15:29.420
Yes.

16:28.620 --> 16:30.420
You knew all along, right?

16:32.130 --> 16:33.570
Knew what?

16:37.010 --> 16:38.820
I'm the Nanwu Saintess.

16:41.010 --> 16:42.320
That I did.

16:42.340 --> 16:44.130
Is that why

16:44.460 --> 16:46.420
you came to me?

16:48.620 --> 16:50.920
At first, yes.

16:50.940 --> 16:53.320
But you know full well

16:53.340 --> 16:54.810
how I feel about you later.

16:55.410 --> 16:57.220
I've never lied to you once.

16:58.780 --> 17:00.280
Do you remember

17:00.300 --> 17:02.250
before my brother drowned,

17:02.820 --> 17:04.330
I told you

17:04.370 --> 17:06.100
I had a dream?

17:06.340 --> 17:09.530
But actually, it wasn't a dream.

17:11.650 --> 17:13.700
It was something I'd lived through.

17:14.130 --> 17:15.570
Lived through?

17:17.210 --> 17:18.940
Actually, back then,

17:19.060 --> 17:20.810
we were already married

17:20.830 --> 17:22.460
and performed the wedding rites.

17:22.780 --> 17:24.770
There's a legend in Nanwu

17:25.620 --> 17:28.860
that the Saintess can foresee the future.

17:29.060 --> 17:31.330
But the reason I became the Saintess

17:32.730 --> 17:34.860
is because those premonitions

17:35.580 --> 17:38.100
were what I had really lived through.

17:39.100 --> 17:40.570
Yet I often wonder,

17:41.860 --> 17:44.330
I wish it had all been just a dream.

17:46.580 --> 17:49.100
I only want an ordinary life,

17:50.730 --> 17:53.290
to be Jiang Si of Earl Dongping's Mansion.

18:06.020 --> 18:07.870
Whether you're the Saintess

18:07.890 --> 18:09.860
doesn't matter to me.

18:11.300 --> 18:13.460
While kneeling in front of His Majesty,

18:14.060 --> 18:15.860
only one thought consumed me,

18:17.860 --> 18:19.210
the terror that I'd never

18:19.210 --> 18:21.220
see you again in this lifetime.

18:23.540 --> 18:25.050
Whoever you are,

18:26.060 --> 18:27.700
my devotion remains unchanging.

18:30.210 --> 18:32.620
(For I shall forever remain)

18:33.450 --> 18:35.180
(the Yu Qi who belongs to Jiang Si.)

18:36.140 --> 18:40.010
♪ I can't forget about you ♪

18:40.030 --> 18:43.600
♪ However long the road is ♪

18:43.640 --> 18:47.230
♪ No matter the cost, I'll try to restore ♪

18:47.230 --> 18:50.440
♪ The sealed memories ♪

18:50.450 --> 18:52.210
This is the first time

18:52.210 --> 18:54.050
I've seen Prince Yan drink.

18:54.130 --> 18:55.860
It's truly rare.

18:55.930 --> 18:57.800
Is it your first time seeing him drink too?

18:57.820 --> 18:59.660
Of course not.

18:59.690 --> 19:01.130
Run.

19:03.080 --> 19:03.960
Once, our chief

19:03.960 --> 19:05.630
led us to a crushing victory.

19:05.650 --> 19:07.130
Upon our return,

19:07.150 --> 19:08.020
he couldn't resist

19:08.020 --> 19:10.420
drinking with us.

19:10.500 --> 19:11.940
At first,

19:12.060 --> 19:13.210
we all thought

19:13.210 --> 19:15.290
he could hold his liquor perfectly

19:15.410 --> 19:17.460
since he showed no signs of drunkenness.

19:18.100 --> 19:20.710
But two hours later,

19:20.730 --> 19:22.110
he suddenly collapsed into sleep,

19:22.130 --> 19:23.130
only to bolt upright

19:23.130 --> 19:24.770
moments later...

19:26.450 --> 19:27.890
Then?

19:30.370 --> 19:32.900
Never mind, I won't talk about it.

19:35.540 --> 19:36.980
Long Dan.

19:37.130 --> 19:38.740
- Don't.
- Please, Long Dan.

19:38.750 --> 19:40.330
- Just tell me.
- No, no, he...

19:40.340 --> 19:42.430
I won't tell anyone. I won't.

19:42.450 --> 19:43.890
Okay.

19:44.210 --> 19:45.620
Since we are

19:45.620 --> 19:47.100
going to be family...

19:47.100 --> 19:48.520
We're already family.

19:48.540 --> 19:49.820
Don't tell anyone.

19:49.820 --> 19:51.130
- I won't.
- You promise?

19:51.130 --> 19:52.570
I promise.

19:54.690 --> 19:57.330
He hugged the stool and burst into tears.

20:03.260 --> 20:04.560
Our chief

20:04.580 --> 20:06.860
grew up without parents

20:07.020 --> 20:09.770
and was exiled to the South alone.

20:11.020 --> 20:13.260
He endured untold hardships

20:13.260 --> 20:15.140
and suffered a great deal,

20:15.860 --> 20:18.900
but never once complained to anyone.

20:20.620 --> 20:22.650
However, sometimes I wish

20:22.650 --> 20:25.260
he would cry more often

20:25.260 --> 20:26.900
and get drunk more.

20:40.160 --> 20:42.840
(Grand Princess's Mansion)

20:50.300 --> 20:52.220
Your Highness, watch the steps.

21:05.620 --> 21:07.390
The villa caught fire.

21:07.410 --> 21:09.330
Princess Mingyue has passed away.

21:10.690 --> 21:12.350
Zhu Ziyu killed her.

21:12.370 --> 21:13.760
I failed to protect her.

21:13.780 --> 21:14.730
I deserve death.

21:14.730 --> 21:16.460
You're lying!

21:20.100 --> 21:21.540
No way.

21:21.650 --> 21:22.970
Why are you lying to me?

21:22.970 --> 21:24.000
Why?

21:24.020 --> 21:25.460
Move aside!

21:26.970 --> 21:28.780
Your Highness, you mustn't open it.

21:28.780 --> 21:30.560
Move aside! Stop holding me back!

21:30.580 --> 21:32.810
Your Highness, no.

21:33.650 --> 21:35.180
Get out of the way!

21:37.410 --> 21:38.850
Move!

21:39.210 --> 21:40.950
Your Highness, you mustn't open it.

21:40.970 --> 21:42.410
Your Highness.

21:42.650 --> 21:44.370
Your Highness, no.

21:44.370 --> 21:45.500
Move aside!

21:45.500 --> 21:46.760
Your Highness.

21:46.780 --> 21:48.380
Your Highness.

21:49.300 --> 21:51.100
Your Highness.

22:04.260 --> 22:05.700
Who is this?

22:07.780 --> 22:09.330
Who is this?

22:12.730 --> 22:14.330
She isn't Mingyue.

22:14.370 --> 22:16.000
That's not what Mingyue looks like.

22:16.020 --> 22:18.700
Your Highness!

22:18.890 --> 22:20.520
What are you doing here?

22:20.540 --> 22:21.930
What are you doing here?

22:21.930 --> 22:23.410
Go find her!

22:23.410 --> 22:24.690
Go!

22:24.690 --> 22:25.540
Your Highness.

22:25.540 --> 22:27.110
Hurry and go!

22:27.130 --> 22:29.460
Your Highness.

22:46.340 --> 22:48.250
I know you're

22:48.380 --> 22:50.860
- trying to scare me
- Your Highness.

22:51.130 --> 22:53.700
and playing a prank on me.

22:55.170 --> 22:57.050
This can't be real.

22:57.410 --> 22:59.820
This can't be real.

22:59.820 --> 23:01.080
Your Highness.

23:01.100 --> 23:02.840
I, I...

23:02.860 --> 23:06.010
I know I was wrong.

23:06.370 --> 23:09.970
Go and find her for me.

23:10.170 --> 23:13.730
I know I was wrong.

23:14.300 --> 23:16.260
Your Highness!

23:16.280 --> 23:20.800
(Prince Yan's Mansion)

23:26.060 --> 23:27.500
Darling,

23:27.970 --> 23:29.730
from today onward,

23:31.260 --> 23:33.220
I'm no longer a member of the Jiang Family.

23:33.580 --> 23:35.000
People

23:35.020 --> 23:37.100
will no longer address me as Jiang Si.

23:37.370 --> 23:40.380
Instead, they'll call me Princess Yan.

23:40.780 --> 23:43.050
I believe a good husband

23:43.130 --> 23:44.300
should let his wife

23:44.300 --> 23:47.080
be herself at all times.

23:47.100 --> 23:49.540
You will forever remain Jiang Si,

23:49.540 --> 23:52.660
not a woman whose identity I control.

23:52.690 --> 23:53.860
If my wife feels

23:53.860 --> 23:56.240
the slightest disappointment,

23:56.260 --> 23:58.080
I'll have everyone call me

23:58.100 --> 24:00.490
"the son-in-law of the Jiang Family".

24:01.860 --> 24:03.280
Alright.

24:03.300 --> 24:04.970
I was overthinking.

24:05.890 --> 24:08.100
Darling, I'd like to go home

24:08.100 --> 24:09.670
to see my sister and the others.

24:09.690 --> 24:11.320
Also, it's time to move

24:11.340 --> 24:12.800
all my things here

24:12.820 --> 24:14.570
from my house.

24:14.590 --> 24:15.450
Sure.

24:15.450 --> 24:16.950
It's almost time.

24:16.970 --> 24:18.300
Let's get ready.

24:18.300 --> 24:19.820
We are going to the palace

24:19.820 --> 24:21.960
to pay respects
to His Majesty and Her Highness.

24:24.210 --> 24:26.010
I'm not going to visit Emperor Jingming.

24:31.860 --> 24:33.300
Alright.

24:33.340 --> 24:34.560
After all,

24:34.580 --> 24:35.800
back then,

24:35.820 --> 24:37.840
His Majesty did grant our marriage.

24:37.860 --> 24:38.860
I believe

24:38.860 --> 24:41.700
he favors you at heart.

24:44.500 --> 24:45.670
Darling,

24:45.690 --> 24:48.350
let's think of this as fulfilling a duty, okay?

24:48.370 --> 24:49.630
If we don't go, they'll say

24:49.650 --> 24:51.700
we've failed to observe proper etiquette,

24:51.730 --> 24:53.570
and that will cause more trouble.

25:08.500 --> 25:10.730
You're right, darling.

25:15.200 --> 25:18.480
(Peace and Prosperity)

25:18.500 --> 25:21.490
Please accept our preserved meat.

25:35.370 --> 25:36.710
- Thank you, Your Highness.
- Thank you.

25:36.730 --> 25:38.370
I'm delighted

25:38.370 --> 25:40.000
to see you

25:40.020 --> 25:41.660
united in marriage.

25:42.210 --> 25:43.390
Rise quickly.

25:43.410 --> 25:44.850
Offer them seats.

25:47.340 --> 25:49.500
May you enjoy a long and happy marriage

25:49.520 --> 25:50.630
and may children arrive soon.

25:50.650 --> 25:52.000
Thank you.

25:52.020 --> 25:54.290
You probably don't know.

25:55.690 --> 25:57.760
Princess Mingyue is dead,

25:57.780 --> 25:59.710
killed by Zhu Ziyu.

25:59.730 --> 26:02.970
He then set himself on fire and died as well.

26:03.370 --> 26:04.500
No wonder His Majesty was absent

26:04.500 --> 26:05.890
when we went to visit him

26:05.890 --> 26:06.940
this morning.

26:06.960 --> 26:07.820
We were told

26:07.820 --> 26:09.900
he went to the Grand Princess's Mansion.

26:11.260 --> 26:13.460
(Zhu Ziyu's fate did go as I'd expected, )

26:13.540 --> 26:14.800
(but I never dreamed)

26:14.820 --> 26:16.700
(he'd sacrifice his life)

26:16.730 --> 26:18.420
(to break the deadlock.)

26:20.500 --> 26:22.110
For a man like Zhu Ziyu to carry out

26:22.130 --> 26:23.620
such a bold and decisive act

26:23.620 --> 26:25.190
before his death,

26:25.210 --> 26:26.700
this must

26:26.860 --> 26:28.810
have been a relief.

26:28.860 --> 26:31.900
Although Mingyue was killed by Zhu Ziyu,

26:32.650 --> 26:34.450
I'm well aware

26:34.450 --> 26:35.910
of her mother's temperament.

26:35.930 --> 26:38.040
She's certain to plant this blood feud

26:38.060 --> 26:39.930
at both of your feet.

26:39.930 --> 26:41.150
She is ruthless.

26:41.170 --> 26:42.500
We can't imagine what she will do

26:42.500 --> 26:44.380
to both of you.

26:44.410 --> 26:47.140
Yu Jin, come up with a reason

26:47.260 --> 26:49.600
to take Jiang Si back to the South.

26:49.620 --> 26:51.670
The Chiyu Cavalry is stationed there

26:51.690 --> 26:53.650
and they can protect both of you.

26:53.670 --> 26:55.390
However, the misfortune can't be avoided.

26:55.410 --> 26:56.820
Sooner or later, we have to confront it.

26:56.820 --> 26:58.390
The Grand Princess has been

26:58.410 --> 27:00.040
plotting against us for long.

27:00.060 --> 27:01.760
We can adapt as needed,

27:01.780 --> 27:04.150
but we're afraid of implicating you.

27:04.170 --> 27:05.430
It's best for you

27:05.450 --> 27:07.900
to distance yourself from us in public.

27:08.500 --> 27:10.870
We'll visit you less from now on.

27:10.890 --> 27:12.480
We hope you will understand.

27:12.500 --> 27:13.820
I knew

27:13.820 --> 27:15.800
you are not cowards.

27:15.820 --> 27:18.130
Actually, Mother and I

27:18.130 --> 27:20.150
discussed this before your arrival.

27:20.170 --> 27:21.600
If you want to leave,

27:21.620 --> 27:22.780
we'll find a way

27:22.780 --> 27:24.530
to get you out safely.

27:24.820 --> 27:26.660
If you choose to stay,

27:27.100 --> 27:27.970
we won't

27:27.970 --> 27:29.210
play it safe

27:29.210 --> 27:30.600
like before.

27:30.620 --> 27:31.870
This time,

27:31.890 --> 27:33.420
we stand together.

27:34.760 --> 27:37.280
(Blessings and Clarity)

27:39.440 --> 27:40.400
(Ningxiang Hall)

27:40.410 --> 27:41.410
I don't

27:41.410 --> 27:43.970
have a son of my own.

27:44.340 --> 27:46.710
Yu Jin, if you wish,

27:46.730 --> 27:49.330
I can petition His Majesty for approval

27:49.500 --> 27:51.040
to acknowledge you as my own son.

27:51.060 --> 27:53.450
Your Highness, before you do that,

27:53.450 --> 27:54.340
shouldn't you

27:54.340 --> 27:56.480
ask his mother for consent?

27:56.500 --> 27:58.180
Greetings, Mother.

27:58.860 --> 28:00.300
Your Highness.

28:00.450 --> 28:01.630
Your Highness,

28:01.650 --> 28:03.820
how could you enter without announcement?

28:03.820 --> 28:05.390
By the time you announce,

28:05.410 --> 28:08.250
my son would've been abducted!

28:08.820 --> 28:11.430
It's been a while since you came.

28:11.450 --> 28:13.530
Quickly, offer her a seat.

28:21.930 --> 28:24.480
My son and daughter-in-law just married.

28:24.500 --> 28:26.730
I waited for ages in Jinhua Hall,

28:26.730 --> 28:27.910
but they never showed.

28:27.930 --> 28:29.970
Seems I won't get

28:30.130 --> 28:31.540
my new daughter-in-law's tea.

28:31.540 --> 28:33.170
Mother, we were

28:33.170 --> 28:34.450
on our way to Jinhua Hall

28:34.450 --> 28:35.370
to greet you.

28:35.370 --> 28:36.810
Is that so?

28:37.210 --> 28:38.620
Then why did I hear you

28:38.620 --> 28:40.210
planning to acknowledge someone else

28:40.210 --> 28:41.630
as your mother?

28:41.650 --> 28:42.970
Am I still qualified

28:42.970 --> 28:44.840
to accept your greetings?

28:44.860 --> 28:46.080
Your Highness,

28:46.100 --> 28:48.480
is the "someone else"

28:48.500 --> 28:50.220
referring to my mother?

28:50.340 --> 28:51.800
Although I'm your junior,

28:51.820 --> 28:53.380
I know that my mother

28:53.450 --> 28:55.840
is the lineal mother

28:55.860 --> 28:58.490
to all princes and princesses.

28:58.580 --> 29:00.390
What's wrong with her wish

29:00.410 --> 29:01.950
to adopt Jin

29:01.970 --> 29:03.190
as her lineal son?

29:03.210 --> 29:04.600
Look at that.

29:04.620 --> 29:05.690
Princess Fuqing is truly

29:05.690 --> 29:07.580
the Empress's own flesh and blood

29:07.580 --> 29:09.210
who shares a special bond with her.

29:09.210 --> 29:11.150
I only complained a little,

29:11.170 --> 29:13.190
and she immediately jumped to her defense.

29:13.210 --> 29:15.280
If someone with ill intentions

29:15.300 --> 29:18.240
tried to steal her from Your Highness,

29:18.260 --> 29:20.290
what would you do?

29:21.260 --> 29:23.670
Princess Fuqing was raised by her mother.

29:23.690 --> 29:25.350
Of course they share a deep bond.

29:25.370 --> 29:28.110
Your Highness didn't raise your son,

29:28.130 --> 29:31.670
yet now you insist on blood ties.

29:31.690 --> 29:34.290
Are you afraid that my legitimacy

29:34.410 --> 29:35.890
would rattle your designs for Prince Qi?

29:35.890 --> 29:38.620
Nonsense! You both are my flesh and blood.

29:39.130 --> 29:40.760
Although I couldn't raise you myself,

29:40.780 --> 29:42.190
I've cared for you

29:42.210 --> 29:44.250
just as much as Prince Qi.

29:44.340 --> 29:46.220
You ungrateful son!

29:47.730 --> 29:49.420
Consort Xian, mind your words.

29:49.930 --> 29:51.950
Prince Yan is both wise and benevolent.

29:51.970 --> 29:53.320
Since returning to Ling'an,

29:53.340 --> 29:55.150
he's successfully handled several tasks,

29:55.170 --> 29:57.320
earning His Majesty's praise.

29:57.340 --> 29:59.800
If you hold him in such low regard,

29:59.820 --> 30:02.240
and with Prince Qi around you,

30:02.260 --> 30:04.840
I have no qualms left.

30:04.860 --> 30:06.080
Yu Jin,

30:06.100 --> 30:07.710
with Consort Xian's presence,

30:07.730 --> 30:09.150
answer me,

30:09.170 --> 30:11.190
will you consent to be recorded under my name

30:11.210 --> 30:13.220
as my lineal son?

30:17.260 --> 30:18.700
Yes, I will.

30:18.890 --> 30:20.330
What did you say?

30:22.890 --> 30:23.910
Your Highness,

30:23.930 --> 30:26.320
Princess Fuqing has a valid point.

30:26.340 --> 30:27.870
As the lineal mother to all princes,

30:27.890 --> 30:28.780
even if Prince Yan

30:28.780 --> 30:30.210
isn't formally recorded under your name,

30:30.210 --> 30:31.670
you remain our lineal mother.

30:31.690 --> 30:33.890
We will devote ourselves

30:33.890 --> 30:35.240
to serving you wholeheartedly.

30:35.260 --> 30:36.580
There's no need to trouble you

30:36.580 --> 30:38.330
with an adoption ceremony.

30:44.300 --> 30:46.700
Jiang Si is truly sensible.

31:00.130 --> 31:02.080
Do you blame me for stopping you?

31:02.100 --> 31:04.660
I've longed for such a mother.

31:05.300 --> 31:06.340
But you must have your reasons

31:06.340 --> 31:07.860
for stopping me.

31:08.300 --> 31:09.840
Alright, let me hear them.

31:09.860 --> 31:11.430
I believe the Empress

31:11.450 --> 31:13.080
and Princess Fuqing

31:13.100 --> 31:14.910
genuinely care for us.

31:14.930 --> 31:16.760
Even without the mother-son title,

31:16.780 --> 31:17.690
we would still

31:17.690 --> 31:19.180
protect each other.

31:19.260 --> 31:21.530
However, claiming that title

31:21.580 --> 31:23.710
would declare your allegiance

31:23.730 --> 31:25.430
to the Empress's faction

31:25.450 --> 31:27.150
and signal your ambition.

31:27.170 --> 31:28.890
That would make us

31:28.890 --> 31:30.420
instant targets.

31:31.060 --> 31:32.500
Indeed.

31:33.170 --> 31:35.140
I was so focused on provoking Consort Xian

31:35.300 --> 31:37.570
that I overlooked these stakes.

31:38.370 --> 31:39.480
I understand.

31:39.500 --> 31:41.280
She's your biological mother.

31:41.300 --> 31:44.530
It's hard for anyone to reconcile that.

31:45.500 --> 31:46.630
From now on,

31:46.650 --> 31:48.380
try to see her less.

31:48.410 --> 31:49.730
If you have to,

31:49.750 --> 31:50.620
I'll go see her in your place.

31:50.620 --> 31:52.060
Neither should you go.

31:52.690 --> 31:53.780
Have you forgotten

31:53.780 --> 31:55.000
how she treated you last time?

31:55.020 --> 31:56.480
Then neither of us will see her,

31:56.500 --> 31:57.870
okay?

31:57.890 --> 31:59.410
But the Empress...

31:59.410 --> 32:01.000
Her Highness is wise.

32:01.020 --> 32:03.700
I believe she understands our intentions.

32:04.060 --> 32:06.100
But how can we

32:06.540 --> 32:08.180
navigate this current crisis?

32:08.340 --> 32:09.760
With Cui Mingyue dead,

32:09.780 --> 32:12.770
her mother will surely seek revenge.

32:12.930 --> 32:15.150
Father's name is on the Annals of Divination.

32:15.170 --> 32:16.780
It's inappropriate to present it.

32:18.410 --> 32:19.780
Her Highness wouldn't

32:19.780 --> 32:21.520
want the truth exposed,

32:21.540 --> 32:22.400
which would only

32:22.400 --> 32:24.190
invite the Grand Princess's retaliation.

32:24.210 --> 32:25.730
Instead,

32:25.890 --> 32:27.870
we could launch a preemptive strike

32:27.890 --> 32:29.300
by informing Father

32:29.300 --> 32:31.520
about her collusion with Nanwu

32:31.540 --> 32:33.330
and her plot to frame you and your mother.

32:33.730 --> 32:34.620
Okay.

32:34.620 --> 32:35.950
Then let's call Ms. Xiao back

32:35.970 --> 32:37.420
to provide testimony.

32:43.500 --> 32:44.970
Greetings, Mother.

32:46.890 --> 32:48.330
What brings you here?

32:49.300 --> 32:50.740
Mother,

32:50.890 --> 32:52.770
didn't you summon me?

32:52.860 --> 32:55.420
You said Princess Yan is coming today

32:55.540 --> 32:57.260
and asked me to pick several capable maids

32:57.260 --> 32:58.840
for her to take back.

32:58.860 --> 33:00.040
They're all here,

33:00.060 --> 33:01.730
waiting outside.

33:04.340 --> 33:05.780
Forget it.

33:06.340 --> 33:07.780
They've left.

33:07.860 --> 33:09.650
Perhaps we can send them

33:09.650 --> 33:11.480
to Prince Yan's Mansion in your name.

33:11.500 --> 33:12.910
The young Princess Yan

33:12.930 --> 33:14.840
could use assistance managing the household.

33:14.860 --> 33:16.600
It's a gesture of your goodwill.

33:16.620 --> 33:18.710
I said no.

33:18.730 --> 33:20.670
Take your maids and leave now.

33:20.690 --> 33:22.130
Yes.

33:23.340 --> 33:24.780
Wait.

33:29.210 --> 33:30.660
Let me ask you,

33:31.620 --> 33:33.100
if

33:33.260 --> 33:35.560
the Empress sought to adopt Zhang

33:35.580 --> 33:37.670
as her lineal son

33:37.690 --> 33:39.130
to rightfully compete

33:39.130 --> 33:40.900
with the Crown Prince,

33:41.210 --> 33:42.860
what would you do?

33:45.020 --> 33:47.050
You'd surely be overjoyed!

33:47.300 --> 33:49.540
You'd leap at the chance

33:49.540 --> 33:51.870
for a more noble, kinder mother-in-law!

33:51.890 --> 33:53.630
But what if Zhang refuses?

33:53.650 --> 33:56.010
You'd whisper in his ear until he agrees!

33:57.380 --> 33:59.480
Mother, why would you ask that?

33:59.500 --> 34:01.500
Did the Empress say something again?

34:01.690 --> 34:04.380
How could I

34:04.380 --> 34:06.080
be so heartless?

34:06.100 --> 34:07.580
Crying again.

34:08.380 --> 34:09.830
Zhang isn't here,

34:09.850 --> 34:11.580
no need for your theatrics.

34:12.060 --> 34:13.360
Mother,

34:13.380 --> 34:15.440
it's not what you think.

34:15.460 --> 34:16.540
I didn't.

34:16.540 --> 34:17.920
Enough.

34:17.940 --> 34:19.420
- Leave.
- Mother.

34:19.420 --> 34:20.860
Leave!

34:38.940 --> 34:40.520
If it were her today,

34:40.540 --> 34:41.710
my son would have been claimed

34:41.730 --> 34:43.360
by someone else.

34:43.380 --> 34:44.920
What is Princess Yan

34:44.940 --> 34:46.880
really plotting?

34:46.900 --> 34:48.660
Such a wonderful opportunity...

34:51.210 --> 34:53.410
Do you also think it's wonderful?

34:54.420 --> 34:55.710
I spoke out of turn.

34:55.730 --> 34:57.220
Forgive me, Your Highness.

34:58.020 --> 34:59.540
Regardless,

35:00.290 --> 35:02.450
Jiang Si's rejection of the Empress suggests

35:02.730 --> 35:05.020
she recognizes me as her mother-in-law.

35:06.130 --> 35:07.020
In case the Grand Princess

35:07.020 --> 35:08.830
insists on holding her accountable

35:08.850 --> 35:10.700
for her daughter's death,

35:12.380 --> 35:13.820
I will

35:14.620 --> 35:16.220
step in to protect her.

35:16.840 --> 35:21.360
(Grand Princess's Mansion)

35:33.380 --> 35:34.820
Your Majesty,

35:34.900 --> 35:37.230
Her Highness suffers from emotional stress

35:37.250 --> 35:38.270
and excessive grief.

35:38.290 --> 35:40.850
She needs rest and recuperation.

35:41.330 --> 35:42.770
I shall take my leave.

35:55.500 --> 35:56.940
Rongyang.

35:58.060 --> 35:59.540
Brother,

36:01.020 --> 36:03.290
I have nothing left.

36:06.900 --> 36:08.580
What's done is done.

36:09.380 --> 36:11.330
Preserve your health.

36:12.620 --> 36:14.700
Mingyue was a good girl.

36:14.980 --> 36:17.910
I'll confer upon her the title of Princess

36:17.930 --> 36:19.730
and bury her in the imperial mausoleum.

36:25.170 --> 36:27.180
My appreciations, Your Majesty.

36:30.730 --> 36:32.170
Rongyang,

36:33.060 --> 36:35.060
the dead cannot be brought back to life.

36:35.330 --> 36:37.450
Do not grieve too much.

36:42.060 --> 36:43.670
Take care of yourself.

36:43.690 --> 36:45.330
I'll visit you another day.

36:46.250 --> 36:47.890
Yes, Your Majesty.

37:01.810 --> 37:03.700
Did you hear that?

37:05.210 --> 37:07.620
Confer her the title of Princess

37:07.810 --> 37:10.060
and bury her in the imperial mausoleum.

37:13.420 --> 37:15.730
When she was alive,

37:17.020 --> 37:18.630
they denied

37:18.650 --> 37:20.850
her every wish.

37:21.850 --> 37:23.930
Now she's gone,

37:25.580 --> 37:28.410
and His Majesty is making her a princess?

37:35.290 --> 37:36.730
Your Highness.

37:37.540 --> 37:38.980
Your Highness.

37:44.060 --> 37:45.540
Your Highness.

37:52.210 --> 37:54.250
Your Highness.

37:54.650 --> 37:56.140
The physical pains

37:58.580 --> 38:01.100
can't compare to the ache in my heart.

38:04.940 --> 38:07.770
If His Majesty truly cared for her,

38:08.100 --> 38:09.130
he would never have forced her

38:09.130 --> 38:11.100
to marry Zhu Ziyu.

38:11.580 --> 38:13.220
I risked

38:15.380 --> 38:18.370
my life for him,

38:21.980 --> 38:24.620
yet he never truly

38:24.650 --> 38:26.620
valued my devotion.

38:42.420 --> 38:44.580
Didn't you meet with Father?

38:44.580 --> 38:46.880
I was going to speak with him,

38:46.900 --> 38:48.690
but he went to the Grand Princess's Mansion

38:48.690 --> 38:50.180
for Mingyue's death.

38:50.210 --> 38:51.660
Unfortunately, I missed him.

38:52.460 --> 38:54.110
After all that happened,

38:54.130 --> 38:56.020
Father is in low spirits.

38:56.210 --> 38:58.540
Perhaps it's better to visit him another day.

38:59.420 --> 39:01.600
Your diligence and ambition

39:01.620 --> 39:02.940
will make it clear to him

39:02.940 --> 39:05.450
that you're far superior to the Crown Prince.

39:05.620 --> 39:06.770
Even if he is incompetent,

39:06.770 --> 39:08.660
he is the late Empress's son.

39:09.170 --> 39:10.060
Father will always

39:10.060 --> 39:11.730
hold him in higher regard.

39:11.810 --> 39:13.500
Speaking of which,

39:13.810 --> 39:16.560
there's another thing.

39:16.580 --> 39:17.670
Today,

39:17.690 --> 39:19.560
after Mother returned from the Empress's,

39:19.580 --> 39:21.540
she berated me.

39:21.580 --> 39:23.400
Upon inquiry, I learned

39:23.420 --> 39:25.060
that Prince Yan and his wife

39:25.060 --> 39:26.930
visited the Empress

39:27.460 --> 39:28.900
and she intended

39:29.020 --> 39:31.180
to adopt him as her lineal son.

39:32.900 --> 39:34.540
The 7th Prince returning from the frontier

39:34.540 --> 39:36.150
is about to overtake me.

39:36.170 --> 39:38.140
If he intends to challenge for the throne,

39:38.620 --> 39:40.790
I'll have another rival.

39:40.810 --> 39:43.080
Thankfully, his wife had reservations

39:43.100 --> 39:44.400
and dared not agree rashly,

39:44.420 --> 39:45.750
thus stopping him.

39:45.770 --> 39:47.750
This round is ours, but what of the next?

39:47.770 --> 39:50.110
Perhaps Yu Jin leaked the information

39:50.130 --> 39:51.790
to test Father's reaction.

39:51.810 --> 39:53.540
If Father doesn't object,

39:53.620 --> 39:55.150
he could leap to the top overnight

39:55.170 --> 39:56.130
and become the Empress's

39:56.130 --> 39:57.250
only lineal son.

39:57.250 --> 39:58.930
Then what should we do?

40:04.840 --> 40:08.400
(Grand Princess's Mansion)

41:00.290 --> 41:01.730
Don't touch her.

41:06.690 --> 41:08.370
Mingyue is gone.

41:09.940 --> 41:11.130
You don't have to pretend

41:11.130 --> 41:12.730
in front of me.

41:14.290 --> 41:16.140
We've fought for a lifetime.

41:19.650 --> 41:21.580
If not for our daughter,

41:23.380 --> 41:24.820
we would

41:26.540 --> 41:28.810
have nothing left to say to each other.

41:30.650 --> 41:32.090
Don't worry.

41:32.540 --> 41:34.060
We'll never

41:35.060 --> 41:36.890
fight again.

41:42.620 --> 41:44.060
Mingyue,

41:45.020 --> 41:47.410
Mother will avenge you.

41:48.060 --> 41:50.140
I'll make them all join you in death

41:50.690 --> 41:52.810
one by one.

41:53.460 --> 41:55.290
What are you planning now?

41:55.460 --> 41:57.020
None of your concern.

41:57.690 --> 42:00.020
